# Images Directory

Place your image assets here:
- Profile photos
- Project screenshots
- Blog post images
- Icons and graphics

## Recommended Image Formats
- Use WebP for photos (better compression)
- Use SVG for icons and logos (scalable)
- Use PNG for images requiring transparency
- Optimize all images before adding them

## Naming Convention
Use descriptive, lowercase names with hyphens:
- `profile-photo.jpg`
- `project-coffee-tracker.png`
- `blog-creativity-header.jpg`
